const faqs=[['Is Box Ox a hosted email service?','Box Ox is software you install in your own Cloudflare account. This website distributes the project and tools; it does not host a shared mailbox service for customers.'],['Do I need a domain to install it?','The app can use a free workers.dev address. Sending and receiving email require a domain you control on Cloudflare DNS. Your website address and email domain can be different.'],['What does it cost?','Box Ox is free, with no subscription. On Cloudflare Workers Free, the inbox install has no monthly minimum. Workers Paid, which adds sending and optional AI, starts at $5/month per account, billed by Cloudflare and shared with your other Workers. Every install needs R2 enabled, and enabling R2 requires a payment method on file, even on Workers Free. R2 usage can still incur charges.'],['Can I keep my existing email provider?','Yes. Choose sending only and keep your existing MX records. Enabling receiving can move incoming mail to Cloudflare Email Routing; Box Ox previews the changes and requires confirmation before replacing another provider.'],['Why not use Cloudflare Email Service directly?','You can. It sends and routes mail. Box Ox adds the inbox, threads, scoped domain keys, templates, message logs, signed webhooks, and agent grants on top, all in your account. If you only need to send, or you need SMTP, Email Service alone may be the better fit. <a href="/compare/cloudflare-email-service/">Compare the two side by side.</a>'],['Can I reply to customers from the inbox?','Box Ox sends through Cloudflare Email Service, which Cloudflare’s terms cover for transactional mail tied to a customer interaction or transaction. Replying within those conversations is the intended use. Confirm with Cloudflare before relying on it for general everyday mail.'],['Do I have to use AI?','No. AI stays off until you choose to enable it. Local filters, reputation lookups, and AI have separate controls. Selected mail content goes to an external provider only if you enable that provider.'],['Can my agent install or use Box Ox?','Yes. Copy the agent installation guide for infrastructure setup. Once installed, connect agents through your remote MCP endpoint or agent API with scoped mailbox grants. The downloadable email skill helps integrate application mail.']];
